# M1 Moses English-to-Kannada Baseline

## Objective

M1 is the verified phrase-based Moses baseline for English-to-Kannada machine translation. It provides the reference scores for future comparison with M2 Transformer, M3 IndicBART, and M4 IndicTrans2.

## Completed pipeline

- Built Moses decoder and GIZA++ alignment tools.
- Prepared a 10,000-sentence English-Kannada parallel corpus.
- Cleaned line endings and normalized the corpus.
- Tokenized English and Kannada training data.
- Built the Kannada 5-gram language model.
- Trained the phrase-based Moses model.
- Generated phrase tables, lexical tables, alignments, and `moses.ini`.
- Verified English-to-Kannada translation.
- Evaluated FLORES dev, FLORES devtest, and IN22-Gen.
- Verified that prediction and reference line counts match.
- Calculated BLEU, chrF++, and spBLEU-1K.

## Evaluation results

| Dataset | Sentences | BLEU | chrF++ | spBLEU-1K |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| FLORES dev | 997 | 0.0 | 11.0 | 1.1 |
| FLORES devtest | 1,012 | 0.1 | 10.9 | 0.9 |
| IN22-Gen | 1,024 | 0.1 | 10.0 | 0.8 |

